[cozy_engine:primitives]     = 28 recipes, 27 objects, box/cylinder/sphere parts
[cozy_engine:vocab]          = 64 atoms (27 objects + 9 materials + 5 light + 5 palette + 9 quality + 8 rooms + 1 reserved), 64 responses
